{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get in touch with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to ask about memberships, private sessions, and upcoming sound bath gatherings." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg-1: #f6efe6; /* warm cream */
      --bg-2: #efe1d6; /* soft terracotta tint */
      --accent: #9a5b3a; /* clay */
      --accent-2: #7a8a5a; /* olive */
      --muted: #6b5a50;
      --card: #fffdfa;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius: 14px;
      --max-w: 1100px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
      color-scheme: light;
    }

    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));
      color:var(--muted);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-start;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:36px 20px;
    }

    /* Pattern overlay using external svg asset - ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists */
    .canvas{
      width:100%;
      max-width:var(--max-w);
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg'), linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.85), rgba(250,246,242,0.9));
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: auto;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(20,20,20,0.08);
      overflow:hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(154,91,58,0.06);
    }

    header{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      padding:28px 36px;
      gap:20px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.45));
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      gap:14px;
      align-items:center;
    }
    .logo{
      width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#c07a59);
      color: #fff; font-weight:700; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(122,90,74,0.14);
    }
    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:var(--muted)}
    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:rgba(107,90,80,0.85)}

    nav{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass)}
    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#bd6b48);color:#fff}

    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;padding:36px}

    .hero{
      background:transparent;padding:8px 0 18px 0;
    }
    .eyebrow{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;background:rgba(122,90,74,0.08);border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent);font-size:13px}

    h2{margin:12px 0 6px 0;font-size:28px;color:var(--muted)}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#5d4d44;line-height:1.5}

    .card{
      background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(90,70,60,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(120,100,90,0.04)
    }

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:grid;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#6b5a50}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],textarea,select{
      width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(100,80,70,0.08);background:#fff;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)
    }
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row .col{flex:1}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    button{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#bd6b48);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    button.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(154,91,58,0.08)}

    /* Right column */
    .side{position:relative}
    .map{height:200px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(122,138,90,0.08),rgba(154,91,58,0.04));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    ul.plain{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    ul.plain li{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(120,100,90,0.05);font-size:14px}

    .muted{font-size:13px;color:#6b5a50}
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#8b6f66;background:rgba(250,240,236,0.6);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}

    footer{padding:18px 36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.4),rgba(255,255,255,0.25));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .cta{display:flex;gap:10px}

    @media (max-width:900px){
      main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .map{height:160px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="canvas">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">SB</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Gather</a>
        <a href="events.html">Upcoming</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">1:1 & Spaces</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="primary">Reach Out</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <div class="hero">
          <span class="eyebrow">Reach Out</span>
          <h2>Begin your practice — or ask us anything</h2>
          <p class="lead">Whether you want to learn about membership benefits, reserve a private session for 1:1 or couples, or inquire about corporate sound experiences, we&apos;re here to listen. Share a little about what you need and we&apos;ll respond within 48 hours.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <form id="contactForm">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last name" required />
              </div>
              <div class="col">
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required />

            <label for="inquiry">What can we help with?</label>
            <select id="inquiry" name="inquiry">
              <option>General question</option>
              <option>Membership / Monthly offerings</option>
              <option>Book a private session (1:1)</option>
              <option>Couples session</option>
              <option>Corporate or group booking</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Details</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about dates, accessibility needs, or questions about instruments and flow"></textarea>

            <div class="row">
              <div class="col">
                <label><input type="checkbox" id="subscribe" name="subscribe" /> I&apos;m interested in membership perks</label>
              </div>
              <div class="col">
                <label for="contactMethod">Preferred contact</label>
                <select id="contactMethod" name="contactMethod">
                  <option>Email</option>
                  <option>Phone</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="actions">
              <button type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="secondary" id="callBtn">Call {{PHONE}}</button>
              <div class="muted">We typically reply within 2 business days</div>
            </div>

            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">By contacting you agree to receive messages from {{BUSINESS_NAME}} about your request. We will not share your information.</p>
          </form>

          <div id="sentMessage" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f4f1,#fff);border:1px solid rgba(150,120,100,0.06);">
            <strong>Thanks — we received your message.</strong>
            <div class="muted">We&apos;ll be in touch at the email or phone you provided. If this is urgent, call {{PHONE}}.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card" aria-labelledby="flowTitle">
          <h3 id="flowTitle">What to expect at a session</h3>
          <p class="muted">Our gatherings are intentionally slow, sensory, and held with a premium touch. Below is the common flow for shared sound baths — exact timings may vary.</p>
          <ul class="plain" style="margin-top:12px">
            <li><strong>Arrival & settling (10–15 min)</strong> — gentle welcome, silence signal, guidance on supported posture (mats, bolsters available).</li>
            <li><strong>Opening ritual (5–10 min)</strong> — breathwork and intention setting led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}.</li>
            <li><strong>Sound immersion (30–45 min)</strong> — layered tones from a curated selection of instruments create a spacious field.</li>
            <li><strong>Close & grounding (10 min)</strong> — soft chimes, time to emerge, optional tea and gentle circulation.</li>
          </ul>

          <h4 style="margin-top:14px">Instruments you may hear</h4>
          <p class="muted">Each sound experience is unique; we may include crystal singing bowls, tuning forks, chimes, and a monochord to hold deep resonant tones.</p>

          <h4 style="margin-top:14px">What to bring</h4>
          <ul class="plain">
            <li>Comfortable layered clothing to keep warm.</li>
            <li>A yoga mat, blanket, and a small pillow or bolster (we provide extras).</li>
            <li>Water and an open heart — we encourage arriving 15 minutes early to settle.</li>
          </ul>

          <h4 style="margin-top:14px">Contraindications & safety</h4>
          <div class="disclaimer">If you are pregnant, have a history of seizures, unstable cardiovascular conditions, recent surgeries, or are sensitive to loud vibrations, please contact us before booking. Sound experiences can be intense for some; we will discuss accommodations and alternatives.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="side">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Visit us</h3>
          <p class="muted">Sessions are hosted at {{VENUE_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. For private bookings we can travel to your chosen space — ask about guided corporate experiences for teams.</p>

          <div class="map" role="img" aria-label="Map placeholder">Map: {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}</div>

          <h4 style="margin-top:14px">Connect directly</h4>
          <ul class="plain">
            <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
            <li>Next event highlight: <strong>{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong></li>
          </ul>

          <h4 style="margin-top:12px">Membership & offerings</h4>
          <p class="muted">We offer a membership model with preferred pricing, early booking, and member-only meditative rituals. Mark your message if you&apos;d like a membership walkthrough.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4>Quick FAQs</h4>
          <ul class="plain">
            <li><strong>How long is a typical session?</strong> 60–90 minutes, depending on format.</li>
            <li><strong>Do I need experience?</strong> No — all levels are welcome.</li>
            <li><strong>Can I book privately?</strong> Yes — 1:1, couples, and corporate experiences available.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — held with care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Facilitator: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</div>
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="book.html" class="primary" style="padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#bd6b48);">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="secondary" style="padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(154,91,58,0.06);color:var(--accent);">Book a spot</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      var sent = document.getElementById('sentMessage');
      var callBtn = document.getElementById('callBtn');

      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        // Minimal client feedback; replace with real submission endpoint when ready
        form.style.display = 'none';
        sent.style.display = 'block';
      });

      callBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        window.location.href = 'tel:{{PHONE}}';
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains the contact page and integration notes for the sound-bath project.

Files included:
- contact.html — full contact / info page styled for the "earthy_warm" layout family. Contains:
  - Header with subtle nav labels (varied from other templates).
  - Hero and warm storytelling voice sections.
  - Inquiry form (client-side stub), membership checkbox, preferred contact.
  - Detailed session flow (arrival, opening, immersion, closing), instruments list, what to bring, and contraindications disclaimer.
  - Contact details and placeholders for {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{VENUE_NAME}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}.
  - Footer CTA using {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.

Placeholders used (do not replace in codebase until you have real values):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}
- {{VENUE_NAME}}
- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}

Design notes:
- Palette follows an "earthy_warm" scheme via CSS variables. Keep modifications within :root to maintain consistent look.
- Visual richness is created via gradients, rounded cards, soft shadows, and an external SVG pattern referenced at assets/img/pattern.svg. Ensure that file is added to the assets in another chunk — the page expects that path.
- No external fonts or CDNs are used; system fonts only.

Accessibility & behavior:
- Form includes labels and a basic client-side submit handler (no network requests). Replace the handler with a real POST endpoint as needed.
- Map is a styled placeholder div; replace with an accessible embed or server-side map if required.

Integration tips:
- This page intentionally varies navigation labels from other pages (e.g., "Gather", "Upcoming", "1:1 & Spaces", "Investment", "Our Story", "Reach Out"). Keep link targets consistent with other templates: index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, contact.html, book.html.
- The page mentions membership and private offerings to reflect the "membership" offerModel.
- Keep the contraindications text intact; it is required by the sound bath rules.

Developer checklist before publishing:
- Add assets/img/pattern.svg (unique SVG pattern for background) so the background overlay renders correctly.
- Wire the form to your backend or a form service and handle validation and privacy requirements.
- Replace placeholders with live business details.
- Test responsive behavior and keyboard navigation.

Voice & Copy:
- Warm storyteller tone; sensory and premium language used across descriptions. Avoid duplicating exact phrasing in other templates to maintain uniqueness.

If you need a different variation (shorter contact form, SMS callback, or multi-locale copy), request an adjusted version and specify which placeholder values to seed."}
